          "post_id": "534831",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1039\">What will happen when the following code is compiled and linked?</p><pre data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1139\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  int main() {     extern int a;      printf(&quot;%d&quot;, a);      return 0; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint main() {\n    extern int a;\n\n    printf(\"%d\", a);\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1216\">$\\texttt{0}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1216\">Garbage value<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1216\">Compilation error<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1216\">Linker error</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
