        {
          "post_id": "534828",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1920\">What is the output of the following code?</p><pre data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2034\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  int main() {     extern int i;      printf(&quot;%d&quot;, i);      return 0; }  int i = 100;\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint main() {\n    extern int i;\n\n    printf(\"%d\", i);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\nint i = 100;</pre><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2113\">Garbage value<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2113\">$\\texttt{0}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2113\">$\\texttt{100}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2113\">Compilation error</li></ol>",
