        {
          "post_id": "534833",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2907\">Given the following two files, what will happen when they are compiled and linked together?</p><p data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2920\"><strong>file1.c</strong></p><pre data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2994\" data-rawcode=\"static int count = 3;  void update() {     count = count + 1; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">static int count = 3;\n\nvoid update() {\n    count = count + 1;\n}</pre><p data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3006\"><strong>main.c</strong></p><pre data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3140\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  extern int count; void update();  int main() {     update();      printf(&quot;%d&quot;, count);      return 0; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nextern int count;\nvoid update();\n\nint main() {\n    update();\n\n    printf(\"%d\", count);\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3216\">$\\texttt{3}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3216\">$\\texttt{4}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3216\">Compilation error<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3216\">Linker error</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "D",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "subject": "Programming in C",
          "day": "Day 294"
        },
        {
          "post_id": "534823",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"338\">Is there any difference between the following declarations?</p><pre data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"377\" data-rawcode=\"extern int fun(); int fun();\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">extern int fun();\nint fun();</pre><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"578\">Both are identical<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"578\">No difference, except $\\texttt{extern int fun();}$ is probably in another file<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"578\">$\\texttt{int fun();}$ is overridden with $\\texttt{extern int fun();}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"578\">None of these</li></ol>",
